{"slug":"marilyn-strickland","qid":"Q1898180","name":"Marilyn Strickland","desc":"American politician from Washington State","article":"Marilyn Strickland","born":"1962-09-25","died":null,"birthplace":"Seoul","parties":["Democratic Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"WA-10","f":2021,"u":null},{"t":"Mayor of Tacoma, Washington","w":"","f":2010,"u":2018},{"t":"Mayor of Tacoma","w":"","f":2010,"u":2018}],"summary":"Marilyn Strickland (Korean: 김순자; born September 25, 1962) is an American politician who is the U.S. representative from Washington's 10th congressional district. The district is based in the state capital of Olympia, and also includes much of eastern Tacoma. A member of the Democratic Party, Strickland took office on January 3, 2021.","photo":{"f":"marilyn-strickland.jpg","by":"House Creative Committee","lic":"Public domain","licUrl":null,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Marilyn_Strickland_117th_U.S_Congress.jpg"},"history":[{"y":2026,"o":"H","k":"WA-10","p":"D","n":"Marilyn Strickland","race":"WA-10"},{"y":2024,"o":"H","k":"WA-10","p":"D","v":203732,"s":58.54,"w":true,"n":"Marilyn Strickland"},{"y":2022,"o":"H","k":"WA-10","p":"D","v":152544,"s":56.97,"w":true,"n":"Marilyn Strickland"},{"y":2020,"o":"H","k":"WA-10","p":"D","v":167937,"s":49.33,"w":true,"n":"Marilyn Strickland"}]}